{"seq":3,"slug":"partisan","title":"党派游戏","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorial-game-theory/partisan","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"game-sums","title":"游戏的和与值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorial-game-theory/partisan/game-sums","wordCount":1315,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"surreal-numbers","title":"超现实数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorial-game-theory/partisan/surreal-numbers","wordCount":1300,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"temperature-theory","title":"温度与热博弈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorial-game-theory/partisan/temperature-theory","wordCount":1355,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"党派游戏\">党派游戏</h1><p>一旦左右两方的走法不再相同，公平游戏那套&quot;一个 Grundy 数定乾坤&quot;的机器就失效了。围棋里黑棋能提黑气、白棋只能提白气；Domineering 里 Left 只能竖着放骨牌、Right 只能横着放；Hackenbush 里蓝边只有 Left 能砍、红边只有 Right 能砍。这些就是党派游戏。它们的胜负不仅取决于谁先手，还取决于局面本身&quot;偏向&quot;谁多少——于是游戏不再只有胜负，而有了真正的<strong>值</strong>。</p>\n<p>本章是 Conway 理论最惊艳的部分，同样三篇递进。第一篇《游戏的和与值》建立党派游戏的代数：如何把几局棋做不相交并（disjunctive sum）、如何比较两局棋的大小、如何把最简单的局面认成整数与分数，以及那些既不是正数也不是负数、彼此还分得出高下的&quot;无穷小&quot;——星号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∗</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4653em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span></span></span></span></span>、上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>↑</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↑</span></span></span></span></span>、下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>↓</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\downarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↓</span></span></span></span></span>。它还给出把任意游戏化到唯一标准形的简化规则（去除被支配选项与可逆选项）。</p>\n<p>第二篇《超现实数》揭示一个震撼的事实：那些恰好是&quot;数&quot;的游戏，构成了一个比实数系更大的有序域——超现实数。用同一条 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{L \\mid R\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 递归规则，Conway 一口气造出了所有整数、所有二进制分数、所有实数，还造出了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span></span></span></span></span> 这样的无穷大和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/\\omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span></span></span></span></span> 这样的无穷小。第三篇《温度与热博弈》回到实战：当局面&quot;很急、谁抢到谁占大便宜&quot;时如何量化这种急迫程度——温度、冷却与加热、温度图（thermograph）、均值。围棋官子理论正是它的直接应用。</p>\n<p>阅读顺序建议 1→2→3。本章以 <a href=\"../foundations/game-model\">游戏与位置模型</a> 的递归定义为前提，并与 <a href=\"../impartial/\">公平</a> 一章形成对照：公平游戏是党派游戏中&quot;左右选项恒相同&quot;的特例，其唯一的无穷小家族就是 nimber。温度理论的落地应用见 <a href=\"../practice/\">应用</a> 一章。</p>\n"}